.TH METTATON-BATTLE-START 1 "2026-08-02" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mettaton-battle-start \- play a short battle-theme motif on the local GPIO buzzer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mettaton-battle-start
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mettaton-battle-start
plays a short opening motif on the configured local GPIO sound pin. It is
intended for RFID one-shot use and respects the shared GPIO sound mute file.
.PP
The command uses RPi.GPIO, a lock file to serialize sound-hook playback, and a
short transposed motif so the buzzer can reproduce it clearly.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --pin PIN
GPIO BCM pin to use.
.TP
.B --volume N
Volume from 0.0 to 1.0.
.TP
.B --dry-run
Print the notes that would be played.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gway-toggle-gpio-sound-mute (1),
.BR mettaton-metal-crusher-start (1)
